      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_07",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "여기 음식이 아주 맛있다! 단장도 하나 먹을래? ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "この焼き鳥は死ぬほどウマいぞ！！団長も一つどうだ？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 5,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_07",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아 참, 오늘 훈련은 쉬는 거겠지? 그렇겠지? ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あ、そうだ。今日の訓練は休みなのだな？そうなのだな？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 6,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_07",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "그렇지…?",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "そうだ…ね？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 7,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_07",
