      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_07",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_REST_START",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "으응? 신이 나는 게 당연하지 않으냐? ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ん？楽しくて当然ではないか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 12,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_07",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "축제다, 축제라고? ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "祭りだ、祭りなのだぞ？",
